# FIX (DEEP-AUDIT-2026-07-26 / F-19-49): consolidated and deduplicated.
# Removed redundant `signals.db` lines (already covered by `*.db`).
# Removed `signals.db-shm` / `signals.db-wal` (replaced with `*.db-shm` /
# `*.db-wal` so renamed DBs are also ignored).
# Added common venv directory names (`.venv/`, `venv/`, `env/`, `.env/`).
# Added IDE / OS artifacts (`.DS_Store`, `.idea/`, `.vscode/`, `*.swp`).
# Added Python tooling caches (`.pytest_cache/`, `.mypy_cache/`,
# `*.egg-info/`, `build/`, `dist/`, `.coverage`, `htmlcov/`).
# A-10 PROBLEMS 10, 44, 75, 76.

# ─── Python / venv ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# ─── App secrets + runtime state ────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.backup
session.json
# core/token_store.py + core/qx_session.py state. On Railway these live on
# the mounted volume; locally they land next to the app and hold the live
# Quotex session (cookies = account access), so they must never be committed.
qx_token.json
qx_session.json
qx_env_seen.json
app_auth.json

# ─── SQLite DBs (WAL mode generates -shm + -wal siblings) ───────────
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
qx_cache*/

# ─── Logs + temp ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
.tmp/
upload/
settings/

# ─── IDE / OS artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
.idea/
.vscode/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
